<!--
    German. English in res/values is the fallback for anything missing here.

    German runs roughly a third longer than English, so the short ALL CAPS
    labels in this file are deliberately kept short ("WEITER", "TIPP",
    "LEVELÜBERSICHT" rather than a literal translation of the English). They
    are sized against fixed-height controls, and a word that fits the button in
    English can still push a second line out of the card in German.
-->
